-- brain/.agents/skills/.keep --
-- want-signups-report.mdc --
---
alwaysApply: true
generated_from: "para-signups-report"
---
Use the **Signups report** skill (`.cursor/skills/para-signups-report/SKILL.md`) when asked for the weekly signups number.
-- hand-edited.md --
hand-edited
-- materialised-link --
../../.agents/skills/para-signups-report
-- orphan-rule.mdc --
---
alwaysApply: true
generated_from: "para-gone"
---
Use the **Gone** skill (`.cursor/skills/para-gone/SKILL.md`).
